+  /* ------------------------- chain replay tiers ------------------------- */
+  // Deliberately just the read side here (patch 0224, data-model step of
+  // Replayable Quest Chains -- see guild-idler-status.md's Backlog entry).
+  // Purchasing and difficulty/resolution logic land in later patches, per
